		{
			dependencies: ["72FE4921BBC7E437"]
			description: [
				"The &9Ruins of the Deep&r are an Overworld structure that introduce early exposure to sculk-themed environments and submerged exploration. These ruins contain valuable loot, early progression materials, and clues tied to later ventures into the Deep Dark."
				""
				"Once part of a larger underground complex, the chambers now sit partially collapsed and waterlogged, requiring careful navigation and preparation for underwater exploration."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Within the ruins, players may find enchanted items, brewing components, and relics that support mid-game resource gathering and survivability. Hidden chambers and sealed sections often contain higher-value loot, rewarding methodical exploration."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/ruins_of_the_deep.png width:200 height:134 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Approach these structures with caution—reduced visibility, limited mobility, and tight corridors can introduce additional risks. However, the materials and knowledge recovered here provide meaningful advantages as you progress toward more challenging biomes and structures."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:heart_of_the_sea"
			id: "7CE7BBA16C2E61E1"
