		{
			dependencies: ["72FE4921BBC7E437"]
			description: [
				"The &6Tinkers Workshop&r is an Overworld structure that introduces players to early engineering themes within &6Create - Forge Frontier&r. While the surface appears abandoned, the true value of the workshop lies below, where a network of chambers contains materials and tools left behind by past artisans."
				""
				"These lower sections may include rare components, partially completed equipment, and resources useful for weapon crafting, metallurgy, and early automation."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Exploring the workshop’s underground areas requires attention to layout, environmental hazards, and potential mob presence. The rewards found here support mid-game crafting paths and provide an early advantage in developing advanced tools and functional machinery."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/tinkersworkshop.png width:200 height:106 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Investigate each room carefully, gather what remains of the workshop’s innovations, and integrate these findings into your broader progression."
			]
