		{
			dependencies: ["72FE4921BBC7E437"]
			description: [
				"The &8Ancient Mines&r are a sealed Overworld structure containing valuable ores, specialized materials, and remnants of early mining infrastructure. Once a major excavation site, the mines were closed following structural collapse and increasing subterranean hazards."
				""
				"Accessing the interior requires breaking through the barrier at the entrance. Inside, players will encounter layered tunnels, storage chambers, and abandoned equipment that offer a variety of resources useful for mid-game crafting and automation."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The deeper sections may contain higher-value materials, rare loot, or components tied to advanced crafting systems within &6Create - Forge Frontier&r. Careful navigation is recommended, as limited visibility and uneven terrain can introduce environmental risks."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/ancientmines.png width:200 height:110 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Approach the mines prepared for exploration, gather the resources left behind, and integrate them into your progression as you unlock the full potential of this forgotten excavation site."
			]
			icon: {
