		{
			dependencies: ["72FE4921BBC7E437"]
			description: [
				"The &eTinker’s Citadel&r is a large, late-game Overworld structure featuring multiple floors, crafting halls, and secured chambers once used by master artisans. Though now abandoned, the Citadel contains advanced materials, tool components, and engineering resources that support high-tier crafting progression within &6Create - Forge Frontier&r."
				""
				"Players will encounter specialized workstations, storage rooms, and mechanical assemblies that contain valuable loot and components suited for metallurgy, equipment upgrades, and advanced automation."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The deeper sections of the Citadel may include sealed vaults or protected chambers holding rare items, experimental tools, and relics of early technological development. These areas often require careful navigation and combat readiness due to environmental hazards or hostile entities."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/tinkers_citadel.png width:172 height:200 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Thorough exploration provides significant advantages for mid-to-late game progression. Gather available resources, document the layout, and integrate the Citadel’s findings into your broader crafting and engineering goals."
			]
