			description: [
				"With the &cSeal of the Underworld&r crafted, you are now ready to unlock access to the Nether in &6Create - Forge Frontier&r. Unlike a traditional obsidian portal, this gateway remains inactive until the seal is used."
				""
				"Consuming the Seal breaks the dimensional lock placed on the structure, enabling the portal and allowing travel into the &cNether Remastered&r dimension."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"This step marks a key progression milestone, transitioning you from Overworld exploration into mid-game resource gathering, brewing advancement, and structure-based challenges."
				""
				"Ensure you are properly equipped before crossing the threshold. The Nether introduces new biomes, hostiles, and mechanics that require preparation and situational awareness."
				""
				"Activating the portal is your formal entry into the next phase of progression—begin your advancement with confidence."
